# Role Assignments (ticket 10).
# Needs a Tenant Admin access token with an Active Tenant (see http/tenants.http), a second Membership
# (see http/invitations.http) and a Role in an enabled Application (see http/roles-permissions.http).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9800
@tenantToken = paste-tenant-admin-access-token
@membershipId = paste-membership-id
@roleId = paste-role-id
@assignmentId = paste-role-assignment-id

### Give a Role to a Membership across the whole Tenant, for good.
### 404 for an unknown Membership or Role; 409 if the Application isn't enabled or the Membership
### already holds the Role actively.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}", "roleId": "{{roleId}}" }

### A Temporary Role Assignment: expiresAt needs a time zone, must be in the future and within 10 years.
### It stops giving access at exactly that time; nothing has to run for that to happen.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}", "roleId": "{{roleId}}", "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T17:00:00Z" }

### 400: an expiry in the past
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipId": "{{membershipId}}", "roleId": "{{roleId}}", "expiresAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z" }

### The Tenant's Role Assignments, newest first (paginated: limit, cursor).
### Filters: membershipId, roleId, applicationId, status = active | expired | revoked (omit for all).
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments?status=active&membershipId={{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### One Role Assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Revoke: access ends at once; the row is kept with status "revoked" and endReason "revoked".
### 409 if it is already revoked or has expired.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/role-assignments/{{assignmentId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### What the Membership can do now across all its active Roles, by Application. An allow that an
### unconditional deny of the same Action always beats is flagged overriddenByDeny.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships/{{membershipId}}/effective-permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Deleting a Role revokes its active assignments (endReason "role-deleted"); they stay listed
### with the Role's last name and role.id null.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Removing a Membership (or the member leaving) revokes its active assignments
### (endReason "membership-ended"); they stay listed with member.membershipId null.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships/{{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Every change is in the Tenant's chain: role_assignment.created and role_assignment.revoked
### (payload.reason: revoked, role-deleted or membership-ended), targeting the User.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/audit-events?eventType=role_assignment.revoked
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
